Posit Connect, I should just say as a side, it's a great place to deploy MCP servers.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:13.440
In designing them, you want to be thoughtful about both what makes it efficient for the model to do the inference, but also the security implications.

00:16:13.679 --> 00:16:23.200
